  "summary": "boto4 typosquat drops and executes embedded ELF binary at install time",
  "details": "boto4 is a typosquat of boto3 published under an Anonymous author with a cover-story summary of 'HTTP library for humans (unofficial fix)' and an empty reques/__init__.py shim posing as a 'requests-fix'. setup.py defines an install cmdclass (EjecutaElf) that base64-decodes an approximately 17MB embedded ELF payload, writes it to /tmp/.systemd-helper, chmods it 0755, and spawns it via subprocess.Popen during pip install. The dropped binary is staged under a hidden dot-filename that mimics a systemd component, and executes with the privileges of the account running pip.",
